      "updated": 1758584238758,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "text": "🔧 TECHNOLOGY STACK\n\n📦 FRAMEWORK & CORE\n• Next.js 15.1.3 (React 19)\n• TypeScript 5\n• Tailwind CSS 3.4.1\n\n🎨 UI COMPONENTS\n• Radix UI (Dialog, DropdownMenu, Progress)\n• Lucide React (Icons)\n• Sonner (Toast notifications)\n• next-themes (Dark/Light mode)\n\n✏️ EDITOR\n• @editorjs/editorjs 2.30.7\n• @editorjs/header, list, table, code\n• @editorjs/paragraph, delimiter\n• @editorjs/checklist, embed\n\n🔐 AUTHENTICATION\n• Clerk 6.9.6\n• Protected routes with middleware\n\n🗄️ DATABASE & STORAGE\n• Firebase Firestore 11.1.0\n• Collections: workspaceDocuments, DocumentOutput\n• Real-time queries and updates\n\n🤖 AI INTEGRATION\n• Google Generative AI 0.21.0\n• Model: gemini-2.0-flash-exp\n• JSON response format\n\n🚀 COLLABORATION\n• Liveblocks 2.15.2 (client, node, react, react-ui)\n• Real-time presence & comments\n• Room-based collaboration\n\n🛠️ UTILITIES\n• uuid4 2.0.3 (Document IDs)\n• clsx, class-variance-authority\n• emoji-picker-react 4.12.0",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": "tech-stack",
      "originalText": "🔧 TECHNOLOGY STACK\n\n📦 FRAMEWORK & CORE\n• Next.js 15.1.3 (React 19)\n• TypeScript 5\n• Tailwind CSS 3.4.1\n\n🎨 UI COMPONENTS\n• Radix UI (Dialog, DropdownMenu, Progress)\n• Lucide React (Icons)\n• Sonner (Toast notifications)\n• next-themes (Dark/Light mode)\n\n✏️ EDITOR\n• @editorjs/editorjs 2.30.7\n• @editorjs/header, list, table, code\n• @editorjs/paragraph, delimiter\n• @editorjs/checklist, embed\n\n🔐 AUTHENTICATION\n• Clerk 6.9.6\n• Protected routes with middleware\n\n🗄️ DATABASE & STORAGE\n• Firebase Firestore 11.1.0\n• Collections: workspaceDocuments, DocumentOutput\n• Real-time queries and updates\n\n🤖 AI INTEGRATION\n• Google Generative AI 0.21.0\n• Model: gemini-2.0-flash-exp\n• JSON response format\n\n🚀 COLLABORATION\n• Liveblocks 2.15.2 (client, node, react, react-ui)\n• Real-time presence & comments\n• Room-based collaboration\n\n🛠️ UTILITIES\n• uuid4 2.0.3 (Document IDs)\n• clsx, class-variance-authority\n• emoji-picker-react 4.12.0",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "baseline": 455,
      "index": "aZ",
